WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:03.367 line:84%
Licklider imagined
thinking with computers.

00:03.600 --> 00:07.233 line:84%
Engelbart showed what people
could do together through them.

00:07.467 --> 00:09.600 line:84%
That idea still matters to me:

00:09.600 --> 00:14.833 line:84%
technology that expands what we
can understand, try, and create.

00:14.933 --> 00:19.400 line:84%
I'm building Theorem to bring that
partnership into everyday life.
